    "One GUI automation wait failed before project creation because Ant Select needs mousedown. Continued the same record after correcting the driver; created only one project/first-deploy command. The actual GUI deploy and exposure succeeded, then a final harness count assertion failed after revocation: resumed preflight included its own temporary client, while final count correctly became0.",
    "Preserved failed-before-finalization.json and used a new readonly Node finalization to verify exact app/deployment/SHA/observation/revoked client,0active clients/jobs/experiments, original preservation and public health200 for both apps. This is operational finalization after the GUI, not a claim that the entire UI was rerun after revocation; no reenrollment/job replay.",
